# Laptop (Ironhide): hybrid AMD iGPU (primary, low power) + RTX dGPU (offload).
# Run apps on the dGPU with: prime-run <app>

# --- GPU userspace (kernel module + headers resolved at bootstrap time; see
#     the note in class/desktop.pkgs for why they are not hardcoded here) ---
nvidia-utils
libva-nvidia-driver
vulkan-radeon
nvidia-prime

# 32-bit drivers for Steam/Proton (dGPU offload via prime-run + AMD iGPU).
lib32-nvidia-utils
lib32-vulkan-radeon

# --- Power ---
power-profiles-daemon
